  "content": "\n\n<p>英文：</p>\n<p>此附加模組會將 <strong>TaCZ</strong> 的物品加入由 Berezka API 模組生成的寶箱戰利品中。現在，當您探索各類建築時，將能發現包含 <strong>TaCZ</strong> 物品的獨特戰利品！</p>\n<p>🔹 <strong>支援的模組</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-lost-city\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>The Lost City</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Abandoned Structures</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-structures-aviation\" rel=\"nofollow\">Abandoned Structures: Aviation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-structures-modern-houses\" rel=\"nofollow\">Abandoned Structures: Modern Houses</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horror-structures-by-berezka\" rel=\"nofollow\">Horror Structures (by Berezka)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/old-ruin-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Old Ruin Structures</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berezkas-save-place\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berezka's Bunkers</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>💬 加入 Discord 伺服器以獲取更新、回饋與建議：<br>👉 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/uAhSWWyqy3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>俄文：</p>\n<p>此附加模組會將 <strong>TaCZ</strong> 的物品加入由 <strong>Berezka API</strong> 模組生成的寶箱戰利品中。現在，當您探索廢棄城市與其他建築時，將能發現包含 <strong>TaCZ</strong> 物品的獨特戰利品！</p>\n<p>🔹 <strong>支援的模組</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-lost-city\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>The Lost City</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Abandoned Structures</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-structures-aviation\" rel=\"nofollow\">Abandoned Structures: Aviation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-structures-modern-houses\" rel=\"nofollow\">Abandoned Structures: Modern Houses</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horror-structures-by-berezka\" rel=\"nofollow\">Horror Structures (by Berezka)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/old-ruin-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Old Ruin Structures</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berezkas-save-place\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berezka's Bunkers</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>💬 歡迎加入我們的 Discord 伺服器或 Telegram 頻道，追蹤最新動態、回報問題並提供建議：<br>👉 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/uAhSWWyqy3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></p>\n<p>👉&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ft.me%252fberezka_server\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Telegram</a></p>",
